    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://ontology.komatsu.com.au/komatsu-au-enterprise/TradeIn">
        <rdfs:label>TradeIn</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>A used machine taken in part-exchange on a machine deal, appraised (KVUES) and later resold as used or Premium Used equipment.</rdfs:comment>
